# Synthetic workflow

This specification operates on an in-memory demonstration workspace.
The supplied context, catalog and goal describe its complete inputs.

```tsg-workflow
{
  "version": 1,
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s001",
      "kind": "effect",
      "op": "read",
      "resource": "/demo/calls0/input",
      "out": "payload",
      "key": "input"
    },
    {
      "id": "s002",
      "kind": "call",
      "fn": "prepare"
    },
    {
      "id": "s003",
      "kind": "effect",
      "op": "emit",
      "resource": "/demo/calls0/notice",
      "value": "done",
      "key": "notice"
    }
  ],
  "functions": {
    "prepare": [
      {
        "id": "s004",
        "kind": "let",
        "name": "payload",
        "value": {
          "concat": [
            "ready:",
            {
              "upper": {
                "var": "payload"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "s005",
        "kind": "call",
        "fn": "save"
      }
    ],
    "save": [
      {
        "id": "s006",
        "kind": "effect",
        "op": "write",
        "resource": "/demo/calls0/result",
        "value": {
          "var": "payload"
        },
        "key": "result"
      }
    ],
    "unused": [
      {
        "id": "s007",
        "kind": "effect",
        "op": "delete",
        "resource": "/demo/calls0/archive"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

